  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["LI-700E", "HC5600"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Pattern of a non-automatic weighing instrument designated LI-700E, operating as a weight or weight/price labeller; self-indicating and price-computing weighing machine with associated thermal label printer. Stainless steel frame; scale conveyor with optional in-feed and out-feed conveyors (any number); labeller; control cabinet located behind the conveyors comprising a combined PC and LCD display (Aplex Technology AHM-6127A or ARCHMI-812(P)), Teraoka TPB-03484 A/D converter, TDK Lambda LS75 power supply unit and Pico UPS-100 UPS backup. Devices: initial zero-setting device (max 4% of Max), semi-automatic zero-setting device (max 4% of Max), zero-tracking device, preset tare device, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing device, zero indication; calibration not accessible to user; price computation; PLUs. Interfaces: Ethernet, USB. Legally relevant software DPS700.dll (v2.xx.xx.xxxx, displayed at power-up); alternatively World View software (direct sales to the public); DLLs HeaderDisplay.dll v1.0.0.10 and DPS710.dll v1.0.0.29. The HC5600 is identical in construction to the LI-700E and uses the Tesco Counter application software (version 3.2.1, checksum-verified modules DPS700.dll and Secure.Scale.Module/dll) for checkweighing operation."
  },
